---
description: Guidance for maintaining the multilingual harness starter pack
alwaysApply: true
---

Read the root `AGENTS.md` and `en/README.md`. The `en/` package is the current reusable content source. Keep language packages self-contained, use skills in `en/skills/` only when relevant, and update catalogs when adding assets. Brainstorming is optional. Treat agreements as templates until verified for a consuming project.
